@startuml
skinparam shadowing false

|Student (SwiftUI App)|
start
:Complete Onboarding Form\n(Flat Type, Appliances, 168-bit Schedule);

|FastAPI Backend|
:Validate Payload (Pydantic);
:Persist User Profile in PostgreSQL;

|Nightly Batch Scheduler (02:00 CET)|
:Trigger Nightly Analytics Job;

|R Analytics Microservice|
:Plumber receives POST /batch/recompute;
:Fetch Latest SMARD Grid Data (httr2);
:Compute Hourly CO2 Intensity Curve;
fork
  :Segment Users via Clustering\n(cluster / factoextra);
fork again
  :Generate Habit Scores via CF & Rules\n(recommenderlab / arules);
end fork
:Match Clean Grid Windows with\nUser 168-bit Home Availability;
:Persist Ranked Recommendations to PostgreSQL;

|Student (SwiftUI App)|
:Open App & View Daily Habit Cards;
:Commit to Habit & Complete Action;
:Submit Daily Check-In;

|FastAPI Backend|
:Calculate CO2 Saved (kWh * Grid Factor);
:Store Check-In & Update User Streak;
stop
@enduml